    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delirium</strong> is a first-person psychological horror walking simulator with a focus on building tension. The game takes approximately 30-40 minutes to complete.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a suburban house that reacts to your every move. Watch analog horror style TV broadcasts. Solve light puzzles such as unlocking doors and accessing new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a linear experience with a focus on atmosphere and tension. It is NOT narratively or mechanically complex - it's more like a terrifying carnival ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293250/extras/6023d245906e5be74827841ea322c8d9.poster.avif?t=1740978160\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293250/extras/6023d245906e5be74827841ea322c8d9.webm?t=1740978160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293250/extras/6023d245906e5be74827841ea322c8d9.mp4?t=1740978160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No cheap jumpscares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is chasing you and nothing will jump out of nowhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical interactions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with doors and objects with immersive amnesia-like controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TV broadcasts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch analog horror inspired TV broadcasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-quality 3D audio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an immersive horror soundscape</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delirium</strong> is a first-person psychological horror walking simulator with a focus on building tension. The game takes approximately 30-40 minutes to complete.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a suburban house that reacts to your every move. Watch analog horror style TV broadcasts. Solve light puzzles such as unlocking doors and accessing new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a linear experience with a focus on atmosphere and tension. It is NOT narratively or mechanically complex - it's more like a terrifying carnival ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293250/extras/6023d245906e5be74827841ea322c8d9.poster.avif?t=1740978160\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293250/extras/6023d245906e5be74827841ea322c8d9.webm?t=1740978160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293250/extras/6023d245906e5be74827841ea322c8d9.mp4?t=1740978160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No cheap jumpscares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is chasing you and nothing will jump out of nowhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical interactions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with doors and objects with immersive amnesia-like controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TV broadcasts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch analog horror inspired TV broadcasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-quality 3D audio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an immersive horror soundscape</p></li></ul>",
